{"data":{"body":"[P2] `nextPath` is pathname-based while `current` is a previously opened directory handle. If another process renames or replaces `currentPath` before this call, directory creation can escape `basePath`; reopening through `current` cannot undo that side effect. Create directories relative to the held handle with an atomic `mkdirat`-style operation, or require the directory tree to be pre-provisioned and fail closed when a component is missing.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7obljo","finding_digest":"da2e49b4fbef775d651f3ec76d831e3329f05b02a5c615893a3f5003e6e85e88","finding_id":"arf_v1_3ixetnh3553v2zi7h3dw3ay6gm","finding_key":"filesystem-serdes-stage::open-secure-directory::directory-creation-confinement","identity_key":"filesystem-serdes-stage::open-secure-directory::directory-creation-confinement","line":548,"observation_digest":"142194db76e2e8b95e8f6b974a6d1a3133c176ca45d48d00c6a0631214780eef","observation_id":"aro_v1_cqqzjw3w4lulsxupnoluu3i2ge","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/serde/filesystem/FileSystemSerDesStage.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_3ixetnh3553v2zi7h3dw3ay6gm","published_at":"2026-09-01T00:02:00Z","review_id":"arr_v1_k2i6yr7cmwjj6g2pqvel5ayckt","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"b385efb5b682b0b826dd23171e2a7f916f16e2cb","reviewer":"codex","start_line":548,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":648},"record_id":"art_v1_oazgdbv7mc5vaxjm5bh34aorzv","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T00:02:00Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
